        "Content": {
         "value": "<h4>Pascal Pr&eacute;laud</h4>\n<strong>DVM, Dip. ECVD</strong><br />\n<br />\nFrance<br />\n<br />\nDr. Pr&eacute;laud graduated from Toulouse Vet School in 1984 and went on to establish a laboratory which pioneered canine allergy testing. A specialist in veterinary dermatology since 1987, he now holds a senior role at a private veterinary hospital outside Paris, and has also authored many articles and textbooks on canine atopic dermatitis.<br />"
        },
